# Kept out of the Flux OCI artifact: these run in CI or are published separately, never
# read from inside the cluster. Everything the cluster reads lives in infra/, platform/ and
# apps/.
/.github/
/updatecli/
# The checks themselves, and the rules they run. Rendering, diffing, the binding check and
# the size-profile assertions all read this repo from outside it; nothing in the cluster
# reads them back.
/tests/
/policy/
/docs/
/examples/
# The charts are published by release.sh as artifacts of their own.
/charts/
# The size-profile measuring tool, the DNS check, and the pinned chart cache. `.charts/`
# is hundreds of megabytes of upstream Helm charts that must never travel in the artifact.
/measure.py
/dns.py
/.charts/
/built/
